{"id":"8749982edf417a9c","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-lovaszchainformula.md","title":"Chain formula and simplex interpolation uniqueness","display":"thm-lovaszchainformula — Chain formula and simplex interpolation uniqueness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-lovaszchainformula","aliases":["27-thm-lovaszchainformula"],"display":"thm-lovaszchainformula — Chain formula and simplex interpolation uniqueness","depends_on":["[[27-df-lovaszextension]]","[[27-df-cubesimplices]]","[[27-thm-pbpoly]]","[[27-df-pbextension]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.3.3","source_statement":"Theorem 13.10 and unique simplex-linear extension","source_printed_pages":"584–585","source_pdf_pages":"608–609","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-lovaszchainformula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-lovaszchainformula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lovaszchainformula — Chain formula and simplex interpolation uniqueness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"efe2d4b0294be128\" href=\"?note=efe2d4b0294be128\" title=\"27-df-lovaszextension\">27-df-lovaszextension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0acb3965b289fee\" href=\"?note=a0acb3965b289fee\" title=\"27-df-cubesimplices\">27-df-cubesimplices</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3153aa2be8b0a164\" href=\"?note=3153aa2be8b0a164\" title=\"27-thm-pbpoly\">27-thm-pbpoly</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"53f1b3025ce14af2\" href=\"?note=53f1b3025ce14af2\" title=\"27-df-pbextension\">27-df-pbextension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.3.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Theorem 13.10 and unique simplex-linear extension"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"584–585"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"608–609"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0\">\\(f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LovExt}\">\\(\\mathrm{LovExt}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"efe2d4b0294be128\" href=\"?note=efe2d4b0294be128\" title=\"27-df-lovaszextension\">27-df-lovaszextension</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Perm}(N),S_\\pi,E_{\\pi,k},t_{\\pi,k},w_{\\pi,k},\\mathrm{AffineOn}\">\\(\\mathrm{Perm}(N),S_\\pi,E_{\\pi,k},t_{\\pi,k},w_{\\pi,k},\\mathrm{AffineOn}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a0acb3965b289fee\" href=\"?note=a0acb3965b289fee\" title=\"27-df-cubesimplices\">27-df-cubesimplices</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；规范系数重构（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3153aa2be8b0a164\" href=\"?note=3153aa2be8b0a164\" title=\"27-thm-pbpoly\">27-thm-pbpoly</a>）。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"53f1b3025ce14af2\" href=\"?note=53f1b3025ce14af2\" title=\"27-df-pbextension\">27-df-pbextension</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_n=\\bigcup_{\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)}S_\\pi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_n=\\bigcup_{\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)}S_\\pi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\forall p\\in S_\\pi\\quad\\left(\\forall k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\;w_{\\pi,k}(p)\\geq0\\right)\\land\\left(\\sum_{k=0}^n w_{\\pi,k}(p)=1\\right)\\land\\left(p=w_{\\pi,0}(p)\\chi_\\varnothing+\\sum_{k=1}^n w_{\\pi,k}(p)E_{\\pi,k}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\forall p\\in S_\\pi\\quad\\left(\\forall k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\;w_{\\pi,k}(p)\\geq0\\right)\\land\\left(\\sum_{k=0}^n w_{\\pi,k}(p)=1\\right)\\land\\left(p=w_{\\pi,0}(p)\\chi_\\varnothing+\\sum_{k=1}^n w_{\\pi,k}(p)E_{\\pi,k}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\forall p\\in S_\\pi\\quad\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)=\\sum_{k=1}^n w_{\\pi,k}(p)f(E_{\\pi,k}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\forall p\\in S_\\pi\\quad\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)=\\sum_{k=1}^n w_{\\pi,k}(p)f(E_{\\pi,k}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f),\\qquad\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\quad\\mathrm{AffineOn}(\\mathrm{LovExt}(f),S_\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f),\\qquad\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\quad\\mathrm{AffineOn}(\\mathrm{LovExt}(f),S_\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\quad\\left(\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\mathrm{AffineOn}(g,S_\\pi)\\right)\\Longrightarrow g=\\mathrm{LovExt}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\quad\\left(\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\mathrm{AffineOn}(g,S_\\pi)\\right)\\Longrightarrow g=\\mathrm{LovExt}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Theorem 13.10 与印584–585/PDF608–609的证明已核对。有限坐标可排序，所以覆盖成立。各权重非负、望远镜和为1；第 π(j) 坐标的重心值为 Σ_{k≤j}w_k=p_{π(j)}。在固定 S_π 上，每个 min_{i∈A}p_i 都是 A 中排序最前坐标，因此 LovExt 仿射且顶点值由规范重构等于 f。有限重心展开得到链公式和唯一性。并列坐标下可有多个排列，但均来自同一 min 公式，因而没有选择依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-lovaszextension","status":"resolved","id":"efe2d4b0294be128","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-lovaszextension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cubesimplices","status":"resolved","id":"a0acb3965b289fee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cubesimplices]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-pbpoly","status":"resolved","id":"3153aa2be8b0a164","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbpoly]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbextension","status":"resolved","id":"53f1b3025ce14af2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbextension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-lovaszextension","status":"resolved","id":"efe2d4b0294be128","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0$；$\\mathrm{LovExt}$（see [[27-df-lovaszextension]]），$\\mathrm{Perm}(N),S_\\pi,E_{\\pi,k},t_{\\pi,k},w_{\\pi,k},\\mathrm{AffineOn}$（see [[27-df-cubesimplices]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；规范系数重构（see [[27-thm-pbpoly]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cubesimplices","status":"resolved","id":"a0acb3965b289fee","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0$；$\\mathrm{LovExt}$（see [[27-df-lovaszextension]]），$\\mathrm{Perm}(N),S_\\pi,E_{\\pi,k},t_{\\pi,k},w_{\\pi,k},\\mathrm{AffineOn}$（see [[27-df-cubesimplices]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；规范系数重构（see [[27-thm-pbpoly]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-pbpoly","status":"resolved","id":"3153aa2be8b0a164","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0$；$\\mathrm{LovExt}$（see [[27-df-lovaszextension]]），$\\mathrm{Perm}(N),S_\\pi,E_{\\pi,k},t_{\\pi,k},w_{\\pi,k},\\mathrm{AffineOn}$（see [[27-df-cubesimplices]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；规范系数重构（see [[27-thm-pbpoly]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbextension","status":"resolved","id":"53f1b3025ce14af2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)$ 见 [[27-df-pbextension]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LovExt}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Perm}(N),S_\\pi,E_{\\pi,k},t_{\\pi,k},w_{\\pi,k},\\mathrm{AffineOn}","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)","display":false},{"tex":"U_n=\\bigcup_{\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)}S_\\pi.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\forall p\\in S_\\pi\\quad\\left(\\forall k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\;w_{\\pi,k}(p)\\geq0\\right)\\land\\left(\\sum_{k=0}^n w_{\\pi,k}(p)=1\\right)\\land\\left(p=w_{\\pi,0}(p)\\chi_\\varnothing+\\sum_{k=1}^n w_{\\pi,k}(p)E_{\\pi,k}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\forall p\\in S_\\pi\\quad\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)=\\sum_{k=1}^n w_{\\pi,k}(p)f(E_{\\pi,k}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f),\\qquad\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\quad\\mathrm{AffineOn}(\\mathrm{LovExt}(f),S_\\pi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\quad\\left(\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\mathrm{AffineOn}(g,S_\\pi)\\right)\\Longrightarrow g=\\mathrm{LovExt}(f).","display":true}],"bytes":2512,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-452","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-lovaszchainformula|thm-lovaszchainformula — Chain formula and simplex interpolation uniqueness]]"},{"id":"294e5ee9e62bf770","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0$；$\\mathrm{LovExt},U_n$ 与链公式（see [[27-thm-lovaszchainformula]]）。"},{"id":"4d1a8a4f021bcbf6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0$；$\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n,\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$（see [[27-df-submodular]]），$\\mathrm{LovExt},S_\\pi,E_{\\pi,k},\\mathrm{Perm}(N)$（see [[27-thm-lovaszchainformula]]），$\\mathrm{Concave}_n,\\mathrm{Convex}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbextension]]。"}],"outgoing":["efe2d4b0294be128","a0acb3965b289fee","3153aa2be8b0a164","53f1b3025ce14af2"]}